{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51934","headline":"将游罗浮留诗（江北与罗浮山相望，尝曰：「将游罗浮。」父母怪之，私爲择配。结缡之夕，忽不知所之。留诗屏砚间曰〖见下〗。明早起视家侧井迳，有遗履而已。） · 何仙姑","name":"将游罗浮留诗（江北与罗浮山相望，尝曰：「将游罗浮。」父母怪之，私爲择配。结缡之夕，忽不知所之。留诗屏砚间曰〖见下〗。明早起视家侧井迳，有遗履而已。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麻姑怪我恋尘嚣，一隔仙凡道路遥。\n去去沧洲弄明月，倒骑黄鹤听鸾箫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何仙姑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}